sangati q-prashna

  -- the question graph root — the directed graph structure of a question.
  -- distinct from the bhasha/grammar node "prashna" (which identifies question words).
  -- q-prashna is the structural type of the question graph itself.
  -- words become nodes (vertices), relationships become typed edges.

  "vakya-sthita sambandha-yukta"
  "directed-graph-swarupa"
  "viveka-kriya"   -- the question is a discrimination act: known vs unknown

shabda question-graph / the-directed-graph-structure-of-a-question

